<<
/Title (I built a Ticket Booking Consumer Application using Spring Boot with Thymeleaf for the front-end, where the application communicates with a predefined REST API through RestTemplateit consumes the external API to fetch available tickets, show event details, and make bookings. Users can search for events, view ticket availability, and confirm bookings directly through the Thymeleaf-based UI, while all business operations are handled by the external REST API.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3139 0 R
>>
endobj
